**2.4 Tier 3 --- Trade Modules**

  ------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Trade Module**   **v1.0       **Phases Included in     **Deferred to**
                     Status**     v1.0**                   
  ------------------ ------------ ------------------------ ---------------
  General            v1.0 ---     Sub management, project  Bid leveling,
  Contracting        SHIP         financials, closeout     certified
                                  checklist (basic)        payroll →
                                                           v1.1/v2.0

  Electrical         v1.0 ---     Rough-In, Trim/Device,   Full at launch
                     SHIP         Final --- full phase set 

  Plumbing /         v1.0 ---     Underground, Rough-In,   Full at launch
  Mechanical         SHIP         Trim, Final --- full     
                                  phase set                

  HVAC               v1.1         All phases planned for   v1.1
                                  v1.1                     

  Concrete / Masonry v1.1         All phases planned for   v1.1
                                  v1.1                     

  Framing /          v1.1         All phases planned for   v1.1
  Carpentry                       v1.1                     

  Roofing            v2.0+        Full module planned for  v2.0+
                                  v2.0                     

  Painting /         v2.0+        Full module planned for  v2.0+
  Finishing                       v2.0                     

  Landscaping /      v2.0+        Full module planned for  v2.0+
  Sitework                        v2.0                     

  Specialty Trades   v2.0+        Configurable template    v2.0+
                                  builder planned for v2.0 
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------

Rationale for trade module phasing: Electrical and Plumbing are the most
universally required trade modules across both residential and
commercial work. They serve GC tenants as the most commonly
subcontracted scopes, and serve trade-only tenants as standalone
business tools. HVAC, Concrete, and Framing follow in v1.1 as they
represent the next highest demand segment. Roofing, Painting,
Landscaping, and Specialty Trades are deferred to v2.0 as standalone or
add-on modules.

