**3. Explicitly Deferred Features**

The following features are explicitly out of scope for v1.0. They are
documented here to prevent scope creep and to ensure every stakeholder
understands why these items were deferred --- not abandoned.

  -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Feature**            **Reason for Deferral**              **Target**
  ---------------------- ------------------------------------ -------------
  Cross-tenant           Significant architectural complexity v1.1
  collaboration          --- requires tenant connection       
                         model, permission tables, shared     
                         data layer, and dispute resolution.  
                         v1.0 builds the foundation; v1.1     
                         activates it.                        

  AIA billing            Important but not day-one critical.  v1.1
  (G702/G703)            Starter/Professional customers often 
                         use simpler invoice formats. Defer   
                         to v1.1 when Business tier launches. 

  Lien management        Critical for GCs but requires        v1.1
                         jurisdiction-by-state logic. Build   
                         after core billing is stable.        

  Bid leveling tool      Valuable for GCs but not required    v1.1
                         for core project management. Defer   
                         with Business tier launch.           

  Subcontract            Template-based contract generation   v1.1
  auto-generation        adds legal complexity --- requires   
                         review. Defer to v1.1.               

  Baseline schedule      Gantt ships in v1.0. Baseline        v1.1
  tracking               deviation reporting is a             
                         reporting-layer feature added in     
                         v1.1.                                

  Business tier          Business tier features are tied to   v1.1
  (\$749/mo)             cross-tenant collaboration. Launch   
                         Starter and Professional first, add  
                         Business with v1.1.                  

  HVAC trade module      Third most-needed module --- defer   v1.1
                         to v1.1 to keep launch scope         
                         focused.                             

  Concrete/Masonry       High demand but defer to v1.1        v1.1
  module                 alongside HVAC.                      

  Framing/Carpentry      Defer to v1.1.                       v1.1
  module                                                      

  Roofing module         Defer to v2.0.                       v2.0+

  Painting/Finishing     Defer to v2.0.                       v2.0+
  module                                                      

  Landscaping/Sitework   Defer to v2.0.                       v2.0+
  module                                                      

  Specialty Trades       Configurable template builder ---    v2.0+
  module                 higher complexity, defer to v2.0.    

  Enterprise tier        Requires white-label, API access,    v2.0+
  (\$1,499+/mo)          SLA infrastructure. Defer to v2.0.   

  White-label portal     Full domain and brand replacement    v2.0+
                         --- significant infrastructure work. 
                         Defer to v2.0.                       

  Certified payroll      Jurisdiction-specific legal          v2.0+
  (Davis-Bacon)          requirements --- defer to v2.0 with  
                         dedicated compliance review.         

  Custom report builder  Pre-built reports ship in v1.0.      v1.1
                         Custom builder is a v1.1 addition.   

  API access (external)  Third-party API access requires      v2.0+
                         documentation, versioning, and       
                         rate-limit infrastructure. v2.0.     

  BIM / Autodesk         Complex technical integration ---    v2.0+
  integration            defer to v2.0.                       

  AI-assisted scheduling Predictive features require data     v2.0+
                         volume to train --- not viable at    
                         launch.                              

  International /        US and Canada focus at launch.       DEFERRED
  multi-currency         International expansion planned post 
                         v2.0.                                

  Equipment telematics / Hardware integration --- out of      DEFERRED
  IoT                    scope for initial platform.          
