**9. Language Support Scope**

Language support is a first-class v1.0 requirement. Spanish is built in
from day one --- not added later. The architecture uses react-i18next
across web and mobile with JSON translation namespaces, enabling
additional languages to be added without code changes.

**9.1 v1.0 Language Scope --- English + Spanish**

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Feature**         **Spanish in  **Notes**
                      v1.0**        
  ------------------- ------------- -------------------------------------
  Mobile app --- all  **✓ Full**    Clock-in, daily reports, tasks,
  screens                           inspections, plans --- 100% bilingual
                                    on mobile

  Push notifications  **✓ Full**    Inspection results, schedule changes,
  (APNs + FCM)                      CO approvals --- sent in user\'s
                                    preferred_language

  SMS (Twilio)        **✓ Full**    All SMS templates translated ---
                                    inspection failures, clock-out
                                    reminders, CO approvals

  Email notifications **✓ Full**    All transactional emails in user\'s
  (SendGrid)                        preferred language

  Onboarding wizard   **✓ Full**    Company setup, first project
                                    creation, team invite --- fully
                                    bilingual

  Subcontractor free  **✓ Full**    Portal is primary acquisition funnel
  portal                            --- Spanish is required for sub-side
                                    users

  Safety document     **✓ Full**    All built-in safety templates
  templates                         provided in EN + ES at launch

  Error messages +    **✓ Full**    No English-only error messages ---
  validation                        all validation feedback in user\'s
                                    language

  Web platform        **◑ Partial** Core navigation and dashboards in
  (office/PM views)                 v1.0; full web i18n completed in v1.1

  Client portal       **◑ Partial** Spanish client portal in v1.1 ---
                                    residential GC clients frequently
                                    Spanish-speaking

  Legal document      **✗ v2.0**    Lien waivers and contracts require
  templates                         attorney review per state ---
                                    translated versions v2.0
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------

**9.2 v1.1 Language Additions --- Portuguese (Brazilian) + Haitian
Creole**

Portuguese (Brazilian) and Haitian Creole are added in v1.1 --- both are
high-frequency construction workforce languages in Florida, New York,
and Massachusetts. The i18n architecture makes this a translation
effort, not an engineering effort.

**9.3 v2.0+ Language Additions**

Polish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese in v2.0. Tagalog, Arabic (with RTL
layout), and Mandarin Simplified in v2.0+. RTL layout support is
architected in v1.0 (CSS logical properties) to prevent a rebuild for
Arabic.

**9.4 i18n Definition of Done**

-   All user-facing strings in translation files --- zero hardcoded
    strings in component/screen code

-   Spanish translation 100% complete and QA-approved by native Spanish
    speaker with construction industry background

-   Date, time, and number formatting locale-aware on all screens

-   String overflow testing complete --- all ES strings fit their UI
    containers without truncation

-   Voice dictation confirmed working in Spanish on both iOS
    (SFSpeechRecognizer) and Android (SpeechRecognizer API)

-   All push notification and SMS templates translated and tested
    end-to-end in Spanish
